      "content": "While many herbs are considered mild, St John's Wort is chemically potent enough to significantly accelerate the metabolism of your birth control medication. Even though it is natural, it bypasses the body's standard safety barriers by interfering with the enzymes that break down synthetic hormones, which can lead to a much higher chance of contraceptive failure. Because the risk of unintended pregnancy is real and serious, it is safer to consult your healthcare provider before adding this supplement to your routine rather than assuming it will be harmless.",
