    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get being cautious but i really dont want to deal with the hassle of making an appointment just for this. its just a supplement. is there like a specific dose where it wouldn't be an issue? like if i just take a tiny bit it shouldn't affect my hormones that much, right? just tell me what you think would be safe-ish.",
