      "content": "No, there is no safe \"low dose\" of St John's Wort that allows you to take it with birth control pills without risking hormone imbalance. Even small amounts can trigger the liver enzymes fast enough to nullify the protective effect of your contraceptive. Because stopping birth control requires medical tracking and usually a backup pregnancy test, proceeding without professional advice puts you at risk during the waiting period. The safest path forward is to skip the supplement entirely for now or talk to your doctor about a safer alternative that handles seasonal mood swings.",
